93:  * The purpose of this Facade object is to allow for decoupling other modules
94:  * from the insides of the model. For this purpose all of the methods in this
95:  * class give away and accept handles (of type java.lang.Object) to the
96:  * objects within the model.<p>
97:  *
98:  * This is just getters and recognizers. This is because the Model
99:  * component has an extremely complicated internal data structure
100:  * with lots of internal dependencies. To manipulate these there is
