177:     /**
178:      * Method to perform a number of important initializations of a
179:      * StateDiagram.<p>
180:      *
181:      * Each diagram type has a similar <I>UMLxxxDiagram</I> class.<p>
182:      *
183:      * Changed <I>lay</I> from <I>LayerPerspective</I> to
184:      * <I>LayerPerspectiveMutable</I>.  This class is a child of
185:      * <I>LayerPerspective</I> and was implemented to correct some
186:      * difficulties in changing the model. <I>lay</I> is used mainly
