237:     /** Signals to the tree that something has changed and it is best
238:      * to update the tree.
239:      * <P>
240:      * For complex operations such as import(?) and add attribute(8), that 
241:      * does several calls to this it is better if we defer the actual update
242:      * until later and if it is not performed don't do an extra.
243:      * Since import is done from invokeLater() we try to move this down
244:      * in priority by not running until the second invokeLater().
245:      * Depending on the queue order in invokeLater() this might result in
246:      * updates but it is probably far from every file.
247:      */
248:     public void forceUpdate() {
249:         _doit.onceMore();
250:     }
